WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Six steps from download to trading. No API key needed.

00:05.000 --> 00:14.000
Use the Fabric profile in your launcher. It already includes the right Java.

00:14.000 --> 00:22.000
Go to the Releases page and download GoNuts-0.1.0-mc26.2.jar.

00:22.000 --> 00:32.000
Close Minecraft first. Then drop the jar into your mods folder and launch.

00:32.000 --> 00:40.000
Turn the sidebar scoreboard on. GoNuts reads your balance from it.

00:40.000 --> 00:48.000
B opens GoNuts. Click Autopilot in the list on the left.

00:48.000 --> 00:57.000
Max per trade and Max per session. Start small: you can raise them later.

00:57.000 --> 01:04.000
Click "Enable live trading on DonutSMP".

01:04.000 --> 01:11.000
The button changes. Click it a second time within 8 seconds.

01:11.000 --> 01:20.000
Then press Esc to close the screen. This test capture is offline, so Start looks greyed out here.

01:20.000 --> 01:31.000
Leave the game window open and visible, with no menu left open.

01:31.000 --> 01:40.000
DonutSMP bans automation. Running this is a ban risk you choose to take.

01:40.000 --> 01:45.000
github.com/cody-raves/Gonuts
